"""The mutations of plan step 12 (the editor with an Engine: compile and swap, live knobs, buttons, the preview's time field and devices, the file node's Open,
the notes under nodes; the Engine bridge calls; the time text; Delete selected): run with
    python dev/mutation/mutate.py dev/mutation/step12.py
Every one of them should be reported as caught; see mutate.py. (E is canopysynth/engine.py, N canopysynth/_native.py, M canopysynth/graph.py, L
canopysynth/editor/link.py, T canopysynth/editor/timetext.py, V canopysynth/editor/canvas.py, G canopysynth/editor/geometry.py. They are all Python files, so the
runner skips the build and the extra C runs, and AREAS limits the tests to the files that can notice them. Not mutated, because it would open the real file
dialog on the screen: the test of `file_chooser` being used; and L31, polling the time of nodes that are not preview nodes, which is
equivalent: the engine refuses them and the link skips them.)"""
E = "canopysynth/engine.py"
N = "canopysynth/_native.py"
